{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"cb976bdaab3d48920627d0a7d7e253e7af9397a2f353687afb31854f81be656c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1071},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["开路先锋"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，施洗者约翰来到犹太的旷野传道，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“悔改吧，因为天国临近了！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["以赛亚先知曾说：“有人在旷野大声呼喊，‘预备主的道，修直祂的路。’”",{"noteId":8},"他指的就是约翰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约翰身穿骆驼毛的衣服，腰束皮带，吃的是蝗虫和野蜜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那时，耶路撒冷、犹太各地和约旦河一带的人都来到约翰那里，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["承认他们的罪，在约旦河里接受他的洗礼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["约翰看见很多法利赛人和撒都该人也来受洗，就对他们说：“你们这些毒蛇的后代！谁指示你们逃避那将临的烈怒呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要结出与悔改相称的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不要心里说，‘我们是亚伯拉罕的子孙。’我告诉你们，上帝可以从这些石头中兴起亚伯拉罕的子孙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["现在斧头已经放在树根上了，凡不结好果子的树都要被砍下，扔进火里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我用水给你们施洗，叫你们悔改。但在我之后，有一位比我更有能力的要来，我连给祂提鞋都不配。祂要用圣灵和火给你们施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂手里拿着簸箕，要扬净祂的麦场，把麦子收进仓库，用不灭的火把糠秕烧尽。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣受洗"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["后来，耶稣从加利利来到约旦河受约翰的洗礼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["约翰想要拦住祂，就说：“我需要受你的洗，你反倒来找我吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶稣答道：“你暂且这样做吧！我们理当这样履行一切的义。”于是约翰答应了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶稣受了洗，刚从水里上来，天就开了。祂看见上帝的灵像鸽子一样降在祂身上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["又有声音从天上传来：“这是我的爱子，我喜悦祂。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书40:3。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}